8. TROUBLESHOOTING
================================================================================

Problem                                    Solution
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
"Connection refused" in implant terminal   The listener is not running.
                                           Start ncat first.

Ncat shows "Connection from 127.0.0.1."    The implant connected before you
but no prompt                              looked; wait for the banner or
                                           restart the implant.

"ncat" is not recognized as a command      Nmap is not in your PATH - use
                                           the full path:
                                           & "C:\Program Files (x86)\Nmap\ncat.exe"

The implant connects and immediately       Wrong HOST/PORT, or a firewall
disconnects                                dropped the connection.

Command output is cut off                  Output larger than 2 MB is
                                           truncated by design (MAX_OUTPUT).

Antivirus flags the script                 Expected behavior: AVs detect
                                           reverse shells. Compile with
                                           PyInstaller + obfuscate, or run
                                           in a lab VM with AV disabled.

The implant stops after some reconnects    You set a finite MAX_RECONNECTS;
                                           set it to -1.

PowerShell commands fail                    The script already uses
                                           -ExecutionPolicy Bypass; check
                                           that PowerShell is installed.


